{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03989","headline":"晦日宴高氏林亭 · 高球","name":"晦日宴高氏林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"温洛年光早，皇州景望华。\n连镳寻上路，乘兴入山家。\n轻苔网危石，春水架平沙。\n赏极林塘暮，处处起烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高球","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}